  // mode "ink": one flat colour (the family charcoal unless "ink" says otherwise);
  // mode "color": the icon keeps its own colours: "palette" = its flat colours as measured on the
  // mockup (the first is the family ink), "keepWhite" = white enclosed by the icon is part of it,
  // "tone": "mock" = a shaded icon whose colours are moved onto the mockup colours.
